    narr:narration """This narrative centers on [decision capture at the point of consensus](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture), framed as the product's primary differentiator. The supporting thread runs from that core thesis toward [the sprint delivery and its technical enablers](narr:Position_SprintDeliveryAndIntegrationUnlock), witnessed through a team owner's account of [shipping the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1789809781028_1), [the velocity achieved](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1789809781028_2), and [the integration credited as the unlock](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1789809781028_3). The register of that account leans metaphorical — the unlock framing — while the delivery claims themselves stay concrete and past-tense. Nothing here covers pricing, roadmap beyond the widget, or customer feedback; the span is thesis-plus-delivery-evidence.""" ;
